	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8267"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=356" title="View the profile of Shado">Shado</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 176<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://espn-att.starwave.com/i/teamlogos/mlb/med/trans/bos.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								hush u<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=356"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:jcroft412@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=850.msg8267#msg8267"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=850.msg8267#msg8267">Re: Conviction...no loyalty to their guildees</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #27 on:</b> June 05, 2004, 12:18:16 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I detect a hint of sarcasm, not bashing his own guild.<br />This is a huge overreaction. The funny thing is.. he likely had to sit out of phase1 and disbanded his guild over that, which is actually hilarious. You_do_phase1_everyday_you_do_Potime. Which when you&#039;re learning it... will be alot of fucking times. Leadership can&#039;t make everyone happy all the time, you have got to learn to do whats best for the guild. If that means you hand over your spot for an hour so the guild can beat Boring_shit_anyway_01 then so be it, fuck your aa&#039;s when it comes down to your lack of experience with an encounter vs. someones actual experience with an encounter. Grats on Conviction btw, you got this tard to weed himself out instead of having to do it at a bad time down the road.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: June 05, 2004, 12:22:24 am by Shado</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />[65 Deceiver] <a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=358551" target="_blank">Shadobane</a> (Dark Elf) &lt;<a href="http://www.ascentguild.com" target="_blank">Ascent</a>&gt;<br /><b>RETIRED</b>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8269"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402" title="View the profile of Callon">Callon</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 320<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/opus.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Warpig<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=402"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:murgen21@yahoo.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=850.msg8269#msg8269"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=850.msg8269#msg8269">Re: Conviction...no loyalty to their guildees</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #28 on:</b> June 05, 2004, 12:30:40 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Eh, like I said, drunk is a possibility.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /><br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Do you really need all 120 people to take down major bosses ?&nbsp; Now you have almost a full raid sitting outside time and most god raids,&nbsp; but hey your in time gradz.</div><br />I think they only had 120 or so at the beginning of the app process and many people were turned down.&nbsp; I could be wrong though.&nbsp; I don&#039;t know how many they run on a given night now.&nbsp; <br /><br />Look on the bright side, if you&#039;re a high end guild who could use a few more members, Time&#039;s 72 person limit will probably lead to some disgruntled Conviction members.&nbsp; You can recruit fully Time flagged and maybe even Kod&#039;Taz flagged members.&nbsp; No need to backflag!&nbsp; Woot!&nbsp; Thank Conviction.&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
